{"body":"### Squash resume aborts on unsupported

**Medium Severity**

<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->
`resolveLatestCheckpoint` returns as soon as any trailer checkpoint has an unsupported `checkpoint_version`, even after it has already loaded other readable checkpoints into `infoMap`. Squash-merge resume is supposed to pick the latest readable checkpoint and only error when none are readable, so mixed trailer lists incorrectly fail instead of resuming.
